tu.be/-DN4P92Wp8Y?t=1365"]},{"field":"mpg","text":"Atlanta is reported to be very cautious with his minutes.","sources":["https://youtu.be/4gw4W4RTolY?t=938"]},{"field":"games_out","text":"An expert says he probably will not start the season healthy, but gives no timeline. I set a small 2 games.","sources":["https://youtu.be/uI6umXsE7Vk?t=1040"]}]}],"base_sources":["espn","fanscout","fantasypros","fantrax","own-stat","yahoo"]}